{"title":"Career roadmap · AWS/Azure Associate","role":"AWS/Azure Associate","summary":"An AWS/Azure Associate is an entry-level cloud professional who helps deploy, configure, monitor and maintain applications and infrastructure on cloud platforms.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An AWS/Azure Associate is an entry-level cloud professional who helps deploy, configure, monitor and maintain applications and infrastructure on cloud platforms."},{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA graduate specialising in Cloud Computing/DevOps, the role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud computing"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Virtualisation"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Security"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Containers"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Infrastructure as Code"},{"text":"Monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The important distinction is that AWS/Azure Associate is not a single universal job title. It is better treated as a career direction that can lead to roles such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud Support Associate"},{"text":"Cloud Engineer — Junior"},{"text":"Cloud Operations Associate"},{"text":"DevOps Engineer — Junior"},{"text":"Cloud Administrator"},{"text":"Infrastructure Engineer — Junior"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Cloud/DevOps","Linux","Networking","AWS/Azure","Git","Docker","CI/CD","Terraform","Python/Bash","Security"],"sep":"+","label":"Best-fit combination"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"UG Year 1"},{"text":"Linux + networking + programming"}],[{"text":"UG Year 2"},{"text":"Cloud fundamentals + databases"}],[{"text":"UG Year 3"},{"text":"AWS/Azure + Docker + CI/CD"}],[{"text":"Final year"},{"text":"Terraform + Kubernetes + cloud project"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Cloud Support / Cloud 